---
const steps = [
  { n: "01", label: "Pick what you need", body: "Workshop or Sprint. If Sprint, build a feature or prove a plan." },
  { n: "02", label: "Sign in the flow", body: "Terms and a standard NDA — accepted with a click, no email tennis." },
  { n: "03", label: "Pick a date", body: "Day 0 — a short call to meet and align. Booked from a calendar." },
  { n: "04", label: "Welcome pack", body: "Worksheet, contract, and a Slack channel with the senior team in it." },
];
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-[120px]" style="background: #2B2660;">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-6">

    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-coral mb-6 md:mb-8">Starting</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end gap-6 mb-12">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-cream leading-[1.02] tracking-tight max-w-3xl">
        Starting takes moments,<br/>
        <span style="color: #a09cbe;">not meetings.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <p class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl leading-snug mb-16 max-w-3xl" style="color: #d8d2ee;">
      Click <em class="not-italic text-cream">Book a Sprint</em>, pick what you need, and you’re booked — terms and NDA handled in the same flow. You’ll get a welcome pack with a short worksheet, and we’ll drop you into a Slack channel with the team. By the time we meet, we’ve done our homework. <span class="text-cream">Day 1 is real work, not introductions.</span>
    </p>

    <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-px rounded overflow-hidden" style="background: #3d3870;">
      {steps.map((s) => (
        <li class="p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col gap-3" style="background: #1F1B4A;">
          <span class="font-serif text-4xl text-coral leading-none">{s.n}</span>
          <p class="font-serif text-xl text-cream leading-snug">{s.label}</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: #a09cbe;">{s.body}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

    <p class="mt-12 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl" style="color: #a09cbe;">
      Scheduling ping-pong shouldn’t be the thing in your way. Reach out for a chat if you’d rather — <a href="mailto:workshop@allshapes.io" class="text-cream hover:text-coral transition-colors underline-offset-2 hover:underline">workshop@allshapes.io</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
